  "title": "'Best Answer' is misleading - should be 'Solution'",
  "content": "<p>On the old forum, we had ‘Mark As Solution’</p><p>This is good: people come to the forum looking for solutions - so it is important to mark when a solution is found.</p><p> </p><p>The current forum calls this ‘Best Answer’ instead.</p><p>This is bad: the best answer  does not necessarily solve the problem!</p><p> </p><p>It is misleading and <strong>does </strong>confuse new members - see:</p><oembed url=\"https://community.st.com/feedback-forum-118/what-s-going-on-with-these-multiple-best-answer-notifications-167361?postid=746030#post746030\"></oembed><p> </p>",
